<tr><td colspan=2><font face='Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica' size=2>Don't f*ck with something that's already this damn fun too play. Most people play the game for one reason or another, but probably the majority would be for teamwork or for fun. If you take the fun away you will only be left with the little bastards that whinge, the total idiots that accuse you of cheating and the people who don't play a decent game.
