As for the grenade issue:

1). Concs: This is one reason why I like the medic/scout not that I play the class that often but when I do this is why I play them because of the jumping. If you take the conc's out, why not take away bazooka for the soldier because he rocket jumps too. See my point? its stupid to take away the concussion grenades.

