<tr><td colspan=2><font face='Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica' size=2>~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~CONTINUED~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
And they should spend time getting the bugs out of the game, i know atleast 4, one is how you can build a floating sg, or a compressed sg. next is the sg's underwater in cz2, not sure if thats a bug but it isn't right. Also you can make any weapon you have shoot any ammo you have, if you dont know how to do this email me and ill explain, which is very misleading. Also the map 2morfort is screwed i dont know why any server would run it, the whole maps roof isn't locked, you can fly across map. A really screwed up thing is that people can put out spy grens then switch teams and the grenade hurts their own team, might also work with other grens i dont know. Last thing i can think of off top of my head now is how a spy can go in a dor and fign so the dorr is jammed shut or open witch can screw things up and get him stuck inside the wall above door. Please send valve all of our letters so they know what we're thinking, if you dont get anything im saying then email me. cyberson00@aol.com   VALVE HAS GIVEN US MORE THAN YOU CAN IMAGINE, HALHLIFE WAS ONE OF THE GREATEST GAMES EVER MADE AND TFC IS FREE! TF2 will be amazing, so if you dont  like v1.5 then screw it and just hold out for a month until TF2 you'll love it just have faith and remember that they are doing this to try to make game better, atleast they're involved.</font></td></tr>
