<tr><td colspan=2><font face='Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica' size=2>Ok, Im a sorry conc'er but I still thing they should stay.  Im practicing on them and I can do it pretty well now, or atleast better then before.  If they take out conc's they are fucking with the teamwork factor of tfc, isn't thats what scouts and meds are for?  They are the speedy bastards that slip by the slower classes to get the much needed caps while a soldier blocks or something and an engie ( with his emps that I believe he should be able to keep ) plays D to keep the other team from capping.

Taking away the conc fucks this up because you then have the scouts and meds stuck right there with the HWs and thus they end up as fucking ground beef all over the wall.  Make the damn HWs work their chubby asses and find some strategys to take out the scouts and meds.</font></td></tr>
