.... valve is fucking up the fun in tfc if you want realistic go play counter strike but leave tfc how it is damn it.. dont take away mivs thats fair is we have concs let them have there mivis   just dont fuck up tfc ... by the way I GIVE A FUCK ABOUT CONCS not conqs you idiot but concs</font></td></tr>
