<tr><td colspan=2><font face='Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica' size=2>EMPs should definitely be untouched, though if they must, reduce the number that can be carried at once, as was done with MIRVs. Concs I could care less about, conc jumping is an abberation that should be removed from the game - it should not have been there to start with. It is certainly not realistic, serves only to get around the map designer's intended entry limitations, and allows the lazy ass medic/scout to moev mroe quickly from point A to point B.

